      "value": "@{5f2f18d614baad5646416505|full_name}: Yes I was saying the same issue of rotating chest appear when feet are set to animation and you stand still.\nAuto foot step make the hips go whoosh when changing direction, but not when off. What would happen with animation only in movement as you do for FBT.",
